#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:3
#: 9cbef5da1f5b48eba3eeea6d0af5a58c
msgid ""
"ROS 2 3D visualization library built on Viser. **Launch it from fa-py-"
"libraries**, not as a standalone product entry and not from lerobot_ros2."
