#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:20
#: 197f35f7d3564dfd907e117935120303
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all          # Python 3.12 env; installs ros2-viser among other submodules\n"
"./run.sh viser\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all          # Python 3.12 env; installs ros2-viser among other submodules\n"
"./run.sh viser\n"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:27
#: 9d9e3858c95a4a58b9ee23e6772b1779
msgid ""
"`./run.sh` with no arguments opens a menu; item 1 is `ros2-viser launch`. "
"See [fa-py-libraries](2-fa_py_libraries.md)."
msgstr ""
"`./run.sh` 不带参数会打开菜单；第 1 项是 `ros2-viser launch`。见 [fa-py-"
"libraries](2-fa_py_libraries.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:29
#: 237fe3db53df4b4f939efa7fa88fc968
msgid ""
"lerobot_ros2 / robot_action_composer may list a PyPI extra `viser>=0.2` for "
"grasp-generation UI. That is a **library dependency**, not the ros2-viser "
"launcher."
msgstr ""
"lerobot_ros2 / robot_action_composer 可能列出 PyPI extra `viser>=0.2` 用于抓取生成 "
"UI。那是**库依赖**，不是 ros2-viser 启动器。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:31
#: bba0183cf805474484c0c9d133abf12f
msgid "Library install (package development)"
msgstr "库安装（开发该软件包时）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:33
#: 01291e22f7aa4317b542da6400376be9
msgid ""
"When you are working on the `ros2_viser` tree itself (from the README):"
msgstr "在 `ros2_viser` 源码树里开发时（来自 README）："

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:35
#: 67a2f8d48f42495b9a43e556e90796b9
msgid ""
"cd ros2_viser\n"
"pip install -e .\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ros2_viser\n"
"pip install -e .\n"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:40
#: bee84829a1e74f36a57e2cbc55999c19
msgid ""
"Requires `ros2-robot-interface`. Do not treat `pip install ros2-viser` from "
"a random venv as the stack’s main entry."
msgstr ""
"需要 `ros2-robot-interface`。不要把随便一个虚拟环境里的 `pip install ros2-viser` 当成技术栈主入口。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:42
#: 039cd0a97bf74f1fbf8ad2af534ccf2a
msgid "Embedding (README API)"
msgstr "嵌入（README API）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:44
#: b28bfb50b922488ebc71ba79f541cd16
msgid ""
"Class names below match the package README (`ROS2ViserVisualizer` / "
"`ROS2ViserConfig`). There is no `ViserVisualizer` class in this repo."
msgstr ""
"下列类名与软件包 README 一致（`ROS2ViserVisualizer` / `ROS2ViserConfig`）。本仓库没有 "
"`ViserVisualizer` 类。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:46
#: bb53894484da45ecab49717cfef2db90
msgid ""
"from ros2_viser import ROS2ViserVisualizer, ROS2ViserConfig\n"
"import time\n"
"\n"
"config = ROS2ViserConfig(\n"
"    robot_description_topic=\"/robot_description\",\n"
"    joint_states_topic=\"/joint_states\",\n"
"    root_node_name=\"/robot\",\n"
"    update_rate=30.0,\n"
")\n"
"visualizer = ROS2ViserVisualizer(config)\n"
"visualizer.start()\n"
"try:\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        time.sleep(1)\n"
"except KeyboardInterrupt:\n"
"    visualizer.stop()\n"
msgstr ""
"from ros2_viser import ROS2ViserVisualizer, ROS2ViserConfig\n"
"import time\n"
"\n"
"config = ROS2ViserConfig(\n"
"    robot_description_topic=\"/robot_description\",\n"
"    joint_states_topic=\"/joint_states\",\n"
"    root_node_name=\"/robot\",\n"
"    update_rate=30.0,\n"
")\n"
"visualizer = ROS2ViserVisualizer(config)\n"
"visualizer.start()\n"
"try:\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        time.sleep(1)\n"
"except KeyboardInterrupt:\n"
"    visualizer.stop()\n"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:65
#: 5957b433ec9440ef9c0a372d44b0da02
msgid ""
"Config fields documented in the README: `robot_description_topic`, "
"`joint_states_topic`, `root_node_name`, `update_rate`, `auto_connect`, "
"`enable_fsm_panel`, `enable_gripper_panel`."
msgstr ""
"README "
"中的配置字段：`robot_description_topic`、`joint_states_topic`、`root_node_name`、`update_rate`、`auto_connect`、`enable_fsm_panel`、`enable_gripper_panel`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md:67
#: be0a959a44614456815bfda7da752da8
msgid ""
"Needs `/robot_description` and `/joint_states` publishing. Joint names must "
"match the URDF."
msgstr "需要正在发布 `/robot_description` 与 `/joint_states`。关节名必须与 URDF 一致。"

